                                "sense_id": "2ce8bbaf-811f-3254-89e8-be562b9139e2",
                                "text": "Westmeath met for the first time in ten years, Wicklow in fifteen, Tyrone in fourteen; in Leinster, King's County was the only one as yet unconvened."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4b41ea05-243a-4b7f-9bda-14b2b0210a00",
                                "sense_id": "2ce8bbaf-811f-3254-89e8-be562b9139e2",
                                "text": "Other options include retracing the convening steps, referring the motivated client to an individual therapist, granting a private session, or treating the unconvened family systemically through that subgroup motivated to participate."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0c253bd0-04e3-4e88-8d15-8371ed34ca04",
                                "sense_id": "2ce8bbaf-811f-3254-89e8-be562b9139e2",
                                "text": "Because the EDC Treaty faced an uncertain future in the French Assembly, the Mixed Board remained unconvened."
